Sea Farm

Sea farms grow food and goods from the sea, consuming labor, water, and energy.

Must be built entirely on water tiles (lake, river, or pond).

IMG_1[This is a sea farm]: images/tiles/seafarm0.png
IMG_2[and this its icon]: images/gui/buttonpanel/parks/seafarm.png

SUBH: Formulas

180 labor + 200 lo-volt + 10 water => 350 food + 8 goods

Production scales proportionally with available labor.

ALSO[See also:]: food, goods, market, tech-level, transport, commodities, power
